Also in the mix: an Ars Technica report on OpenAI models and an Anthropic warning.

9
00:00:43,875 --> 00:00:52,587
Anthropic: Per an FT report (anonymous sources, via Simon Willison), Q3 revenue of $16.8B.

10
00:00:52,587 --> 00:00:54,862
The figures are not officially confirmed.

11
00:00:54,862 --> 00:01:07,175
More open models: Reflection Beam (501B) and Liquid AI LFM2.5 (24B, built for on-device use) extend the field at both the top and the bottom.

12
